 "audit": "Old /en_gb/size-guide returns 410 (Theory's site redirects to its US store, no separate UK guide found). Footer 'Size & Alterations' page: Womens Tops chart prints US numeric 00-18 with alpha P/S/M/L/XL/XXL (two numeric sizes per letter) and bust/waist/hip/arm; IN by default, CM toggle read (printed cm used, inches in _in). Jackets and Dresses print the same numbers. Labels letters -> US numeric. UK/EU removed (not printed; old UK/EU were conventions). Old M (UK 10-12) 90/70/95 -> US 6 88.9/72.4/97.2 and US 8 91.4/74.9/99.7; old XL 102/82/107 -> US 14 102.9/86.4/111.1, US 16 106.7/90.2/114.9. US 18 (XXL) added. Alpha letters not stored as altLabel (each covers two numeric sizes)."
